  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Mass of fatty acid <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.027</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> in <math><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> solution</p><p>Density of fatty acid <math><mn>0.9</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext></math> g/cc</p><p>Volume of fatty acid <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.027</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.03</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math></p><p>Area of plate <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Height of fatty acid layer <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.03</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
